00:10:11.343 --> 00:10:15.090
(light reflective pop music)

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:18.730
Too many people view
post-University as, oh,

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:20.320
this is now real and

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:21.670
I'm lost.

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:23.870
They don't put it in the
context of being alive

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:25.330
for a hundred years and realizing

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:27.420
they're only 20 percent of the way done.

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:29.343
Almost everything is perspective.

00:10:30.308 --> 00:10:32.900
I think I'm just starting.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.900
So imagine what I think for most of you.

00:10:36.026 --> 00:10:39.776
(light reflective pop music)

